Replace the placeholder `<script>` at the bottom of `src/components/CubeMark.astro`:

```astro
<script>
  import { mountMark } from '../lib/motion/mark' // see the note below
</script>
```

The real script — `CubeMark.astro` is used twice on the page, and Astro hoists and
deduplicates a bundled `<script>`, so it must mount every mark, not just its own:

```astro
<script>
  import { mountMark } from '../lib/motion/markDraw'

  for (const host of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-mark]')) {
    const box = Number(host.dataset.mark)
    // The brand anchor is what already fires the name scramble; the mark loosens with it.
    mountMark(host, box, host.closest('[data-brand]'))
  }
</script>
```

